# Story page: scale
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Golden Scale
---
Buried beneath the avalanche was one golden scale, warm as a heartbeat and twice as worrying.

It bore {name}'s pattern exactly: every freckle, every stripe, every questionable decision.

Somewhere, something enormous was missing a scale, and it knew precisely who had it. I advised giving it back. {name} advised otherwise. We are no longer speaking.
